---
import type { Lang } from "../../lib/i18n";
import { local } from "./shared";
import { photo } from "./photos";
import "./fonts.css";
import "./comparison-base.css";
interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const t = local(lang);
---

<section
  class="demo"
  data-demo="proportional"
  data-comparison="type"
  lang={lang}
  data-reset-message={t(
    "Initial state restored",
    "초기 상태로 복원했습니다",
    "初期状態に戻しました",
  )}
>
  <small>
    {t("GARDEN LETTER / SEPTEMBER", "정원 소식 / 9월", "庭の便り / 9月")}
  </small>
  <h2>{t("A note from the garden", "정원에서 온 소식", "庭からの便り")}</h2>
  <div class="newsletter specimen">
    <img
      {...photo("fern-plant.png")}
      width="1254"
      height="1254"
      alt={t(
        "A fern in a terracotta pot",
        "토분에 담긴 고사리",
        "素焼きの鉢のシダ",
      )}
    />
    <div>
      <h3 lang="en">Small leaves, wide windows</h3>
      <p lang="en">
        Morning light reaches the new shelf. We moved the fern beside the window
        and left a little space for the next green arrival.
      </p>
      <p class="localized">
        {t(
          "Bring a cutting to our Saturday plant exchange.",
          "토요일 식물 교환에 작은 가지를 가져오세요.",
          "土曜日の植物交換に挿し穂を持ってきてください。",
        )}
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section class="measurement-lab">
    <h3>
      {t("Optional type measurement", "선택형 글자 측정", "任意の文字測定")}
    </h3>
    <label>
      {t("Specimen", "표본", "見本")}
      <input
        data-text
        type="text"
        maxlength="60"
        value="iiiWWW 0123"
        data-interactive
        disabled
      />
    </label>
    <div class="sample-wrap">
      <div class="sample" data-sample lang="en">
        iiiWWW 0123
      </div>
      <div class="guides-layer" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </div>
    <p class="measurement" data-measure>
      {t(
        "Measured advances appear after fonts load.",
        "글꼴 로드 후 전진 폭을 표시합니다.",
        "書体の読み込み後に送り幅を表示します。",
      )}
    </p>
    <div class="numbers">
      <span>111.11</span>
      <span>888.88</span>
      <span>123.45</span>
    </div>
    <div class="controls">
      <label>
        {t("Size", "크기", "サイズ")}
        <input
          data-size
          type="range"
          min="24"
          max="72"
          value="48"
          data-interactive
          disabled
        />
        <output data-size-value>48px</output>
      </label>
      <label>
        <input type="checkbox" data-guides data-interactive disabled />
        {t("Advance guides", "전진 폭 가이드", "送り幅ガイド")}
      </label>
      <label>
        <input type="checkbox" data-tabular data-interactive disabled />
        {t("Tabular digits", "숫자 열 정렬", "等幅数字")}
      </label>
    </div>
    <p class="font-note">
      {t(
        "The editable width sample starts at 48px. The named face renders supported Latin; Korean and Japanese use Noto CJK. Other characters may fall back. Guides measure text in context, so shaping and ligatures can affect the ranges.",
        "폭 측정용 입력은 처음에 48px입니다. 라틴 지원 문자는 표시된 서체, 한·일 문자는 Noto CJK로 표시합니다. 나머지는 대체 글꼴을 쓸 수 있습니다. 가이드는 문맥 안에서 측정하므로 연결 형태와 합자가 범위에 영향을 줄 수 있습니다.",
        "幅測定の入力は48pxから始まります。対応するラテン文字は表示の書体、韓国語と日本語はNoto CJKで表示します。ほかは代替書体になる場合があります。ガイドは文脈内で測定するため、接続や合字が範囲に影響する場合があります。",
      )}
    </p>
  </section>
  <button class="reset" type="button" data-reset data-interactive disabled>
    {t("Reset", "초기화", "リセット")}
  </button>
  <p role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
</section>
<script>
  import { mountType } from "./type-behavior";
  mountType("proportional");
</script>
<style>
  .demo {
    background: #f8f4e9;
    color: #353a35;
  }
  .specimen {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: center;
    border-block: 1px solid #b8ae9b;
    margin: 24px 0;
    padding: 16px 0;
  }
  .specimen,
  .sample,
  .numbers {
    font-family: "Demo Sans", var(--demo-sans-cjk, sans-serif), serif;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .specimen h3 {
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .specimen p {
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .letter {
    position: relative;
    flex: none;
    font-size: 140px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .terminal {
    display: none;
    position: absolute;
    left: 2%;
    width: 42%;
    height: 12%;
    border: 2px solid #b64c2b;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .top {
    top: 18%;
  }
  .bottom {
    bottom: 14%;
  }
  .demo[data-terminals="true"] .terminal {
    display: block;
  }
  .sample-wrap {
    position: relative;
    margin: 24px 0;
  }
  .sample {
    font-size: 48px;
    line-height: 2;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    word-break: break-all;
    min-height: 96px;
  }
  .guides-layer {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .guides-layer :global(span) {
    position: absolute;
    outline: 1px solid #897245;
    background: #e7daba44;
  }
  .measurement {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .numbers {
    font-size: 32px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    font-variant-numeric: proportional-nums;
  }
  .numbers[data-tabular="true"] {
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .font-note {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  @media (max-width: 500px) {
    .specimen {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: start;
    }
  }

  .measurement-lab {
    margin: 32px 0 24px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 2px solid #9a9b90;
  }
  .weather {
    display: block;
    background: #edf1ec;
    padding: 24px;
    border: 1px solid #a4b09e;
  }
  .weather pre {
    font-family: "Demo Mono", monospace;
    font-size: clamp(0.65rem, 3.4cqi, 1.05rem);
    line-height: 2;
    white-space: pre;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
  .weather p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .newsletter {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.75fr) minmax(0, 1.25fr);
    align-items: start;
    padding: 24px 0;
  }
  .newsletter img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .newsletter h3 {
    font-size: 1.65rem;
  }
  .newsletter p {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .newsletter .localized {
    margin-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid #b8ae9b;
    padding-top: 18px;
  }
  .transit {
    display: block;
    background: #163b3d;
    color: #f5fff5;
    padding: 26px;
  }
  .transit p {
    margin-bottom: 26px;
  }
  .departure {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 20px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #9ab1aa;
  }
  .departure > strong {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .departure h3 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
  }
  .departure span {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .invitation {
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 32px 18px;
    background: #fffdf4;
    border: double 5px #ac9572;
  }
  .invitation h3 {
    font-family: "Demo Script", cursive;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 8cqi, 4rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .invitation p {
    font-family: "Demo Sans", var(--demo-sans-cjk, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .ornament {
    font-size: 3rem;
    color: #5e6944;
  }
  .demo {
    container-type: inline-size;
  }
  .specimen {
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .specimen > * {
    min-width: 0;
  }
  @container (width<490px) {
    .newsletter {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .newsletter img {
      max-width: 220px;
    }
    .departure {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
    }
  }

  .newsletter {
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.65fr) minmax(0, 1.35fr);
  }
  .newsletter h3 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 6cqi, 4rem);
    letter-spacing: 0;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }
  .newsletter p {
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  @container (width < 490px) {
    .newsletter {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
